1
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:15,519
Afternoon falls a little slower now

2
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:19,059
Same old porch, I sit right down

3
00:00:19,059 --> 00:00:22,679
Sun leans warm against the stair

4
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:25,399
Like it always did back then

5
00:00:25,399 --> 00:00:28,859
A little cape beside the door

6
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:32,539
Small steps tapping on the floor

7
00:00:32,539 --> 00:00:36,000
Before I even say a word

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,579
You reach and take my hand

9
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,240
Used to rush through every day

10
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,240
Now I got the time to stay

11
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:51,020
You take your time, I'll take mine too

12
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,479
Every step I walk with you

13
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:57,539
I spent too long running fast

14
00:00:57,539 --> 00:01:00,880
Missing things that couldn't last

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,820
Now the sun is warm and low

16
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:06,739
You take your time, I'll take it slow

17
00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:22,640
Days don't run like they used to do

18
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:26,000
I let the afternoon pass through

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,159
Used to watch the kitchen clock

20
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:31,879
Always running out of light

21
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:35,819
That paper crown, that crooked fold

22
00:01:35,819 --> 00:01:39,640
A small, familiar thing to hold

23
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,900
Funny how the smallest laugh

24
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:47,379
Can set the whole world right

25
00:01:47,379 --> 00:01:51,000
No need to ask where we should go

26
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,140
You already seem to know

27
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:57,920
You take your time, I'll take mine too

28
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,480
Every step I walk with you

29
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:04,819
I spent too long running fast

30
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:08,039
Missing things that couldn't last

31
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:11,180
Now the sun is warm and low

32
00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:13,740
You take your time, I'll take it slow

33
00:02:27,379 --> 00:02:33,680
I've had the years come and go

34
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:40,800
This quiet step is all I need to know

35
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:45,379
You take your time, I'll take mine too

36
00:02:45,379 --> 00:02:47,860
Every step I walk with you

37
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:52,000
I spent too long running fast

38
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,259
Missing things that couldn't last

39
00:02:55,259 --> 00:02:58,580
Now the sun is warm and low

40
00:02:58,580 --> 00:03:01,099
You take your time, I'll take it slow

41
00:03:01,099 --> 00:03:05,300
You take your time, I'll take mine too

42
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:08,979
No other place I'd rather be with you

43
00:03:08,979 --> 00:03:12,280
I don't count what's left behind

44
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:15,979
Every hour has been so kind

45
00:03:15,979 --> 00:03:21,259
